            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Children are naturally more sensitive to their environment, and the air they breathe plays an important role in their daily comfort and long-term wellness. While we often think about nutrition, exercise, and routines, the quality and balance of indoor air is another key part of supporting their health.<\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
