        "text_Ub47yL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Creating a Healthier Air Environment for Your Child<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><h6><em>1. Keep allergens under control<\/em>  <\/h6><p><\/p><p>Vacuum with a HEPA filter, wash bedding weekly in hot water, and regularly clean curtains, rugs, and soft toys.<br\/><br\/><\/p><h6><em>2. Maintain balanced humidity<\/em><\/h6><p><\/p><p>Aim for an indoor humidity level of 40–60% to help prevent dryness and reduce the growth of dust mites or mold.<br\/><br\/><\/p><h6><em>3. Choose gentle household products<\/em><\/h6><p><\/p><p>Select low-VOC paints, furnishings, and cleaning solutions to reduce chemical exposure.<br\/><br\/><\/p><h6><em>4. Consider multi-function comfort solutions<\/em><\/h6><p><\/p><p>Look for devices that combine air purification with humidity control to keep air both clean and comfortable, supporting your child’s well-being year-round.<\/p><p><\/p><h4><br\/><strong>Creating a Healthier Air Environment for Your Child<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Clean air is the foundation of a comfortable and restorative home environment for children. Blueair’s latest innovations help make it simple to address multiple needs at once: <\/p><p><strong>Blueair 2-in-1 Humidify + Purify<\/strong>-  Combines advanced air purification with optimal humidity control, helping to maintain cleaner, balanced air that supports better breathing and restful sleep. <\/p><p><strong>Blueair Blue Signature™<\/strong> -  A design-forward purifier with 7-stage filtration and OdorFence™ technology to keep your child’s space fresh and healthy.  <br\/><\/p><h4><br\/><strong>Breathing Better, Growing Stronger<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Every adjustment you make- from balancing humidity to filtering pollutants- helps create a healthier, more comfortable environment for your child. Small steps add up to better rest, improved focus, and lasting wellness benefits that support them as they grow. <\/p><p> <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
